<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Alaska gains semi-final slot in PBA.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Alaska gains semi-final slot in PBA.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semi-final round games on Sunday in the Philippine Basketball Association third conference, which includes American imports:</p>
<p>Alaska Milk beat Formula Shell 100-91 (43-45)</p>
<p>(Alaska wins best-of-five series 3-0)</p>
<p>Ginebra San Miguel beat San Miguel Beer 94-93 (40-50)</p>
<p>(Ginebra San Miguel leads best-of-five series 2-1)</p>
</text>
